<title>UK: RESEARCH ALERT - Danisco cut to &quot;hold&quot; at CSFB.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Danisco cut to &quot;hold&quot; at CSFB.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Danisco A/S was cut to &quot;hold&quot; by Credit Suisse First Boston and its earnings per share forecast was downgraded by seven percent for the coming two years, the investment bank said on Monday.</p>
<p>The stock is now fully valued after its recent gains and considering the slower outlook, it said.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 4366</p>
</text>
